{"type":"message","id":"702bdaa5","parentId":"1673f8f1","timestamp":"2026-03-14T09:10:09.990Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"有一个 feishu-file-sender skill，这应该就是用来发送文件到飞书的。让我查看一下。\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_c33fcd994b24474e918d05ee","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/yankeeting/.openclaw/workspace/skills/feishu-file-sender/SKILL.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volces-com","model":"ark-code-latest","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773479372477}}
{"type":"message","id":"dc1fb8ed","parentId":"702bdaa5","timestamp":"2026-03-14T09:10:09.999Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_c33fcd994b24474e918d05ee","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Skill: 飞书文件发送技能\n## 描述\n专门用于正确发送飞书文件消息，避免格式错误、权限问题和中文乱码\n## 适用场景\n任何需要给用户发送文件的场景（txt、md、pdf、图片、excel等所有格式）\n## 前置条件\n1. 飞书网关正常运行\n2. 文件大小不超过30MB\n## 使用步骤\n### 步骤1：文件预处理（非工作目录文件）\n如果文件不在工作目录 `/home/yankeeting/.openclaw/workspace` 下，先复制进去：\n```bash\ncp /path/to/your/file /home/yankeeting/.openclaw/workspace/\n```\n### 步骤2：发送文件\n#### 方式A：图片文件（.jpg/.png/.gif/.webp等）\n直接在对话中发送绝对路径，不要加任何其他文字：\n```\n/home/yankeeting/.openclaw/workspace/xxx.png\n```\n#### 方式B：文档/其他文件（.txt/.md/.pdf/.xlsx/.docx等）\n使用命令行发送，不要加任何其他文字：\n```bash\nopenclaw message send --channel feishu --target ou_6c99bdd79dcac29f0dec7fa8fe187882 --media /home/yankeeting/.openclaw/workspace/xxx.txt\n```\n## 必须遵守的规则\n✅ **允许**：\n- 文件放在工作目录下\n- 发送时只发路径/命令，无其他文字\n- 中文文件名直接用，无需编码\n❌ **禁止**：\n- 使用 `MEDIA:` 前缀\n- 使用 `<qqfile>`/`<file>` 标签\n- 使用 `file://` 协议头\n- 发送非工作目录下的文件\n- 在路径/命令前后加说明文字\n## 验证标准\n### 发送成功判断\n1. **命令返回验证**：执行命令后返回 `✅ Sent via Feishu. Message ID: xxx` 即为发送成功\n2. **日志验证**：网关日志中出现 `dispatch complete (queuedFinal=true)` 且无错误记录\n3. **错误判断**：如果出现 `sendMediaFeishu failed`、`path-not-allowed`、权限错误等记录，即为发送失败\n\n### 注意\n只能确认我方发送成功，无法100%确认用户侧收到（可能存在网络/飞书延迟）。如果发送失败，自动重试最多2次，重试失败则告知用户具体错误原因。\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1773479409995}}
{"type":"message","id":"e792125f","parentId":"dc1fb8ed","timestamp":"2026-03-14T09:10:40.939Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"我找到了 feishu-file-sender skill，但这里用的是 `--target ou_6c99bdd79dcac29f0dec7fa8fe187882`，这是用户ID而不是群ID。我需要找到如何发送到群聊。\n\n让我看看有没有其他skill或者查看 feishu-conversation-helper 的内容。\n\n另外，我需要确认如何发送到群ID `oc_00c2c690e5a60b6803a38b121568e4c1`。\n\n让我先看看 feishu-conversation-helper 有什么内容。\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_fd69e0de05d3472d95accd3a","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/yankeeting/.openclaw/workspace/skills/feishu-conversation-helper.disabled/SKILL.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volces-com","model":"ark-code-latest","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773479409998}}
{"type":"message","id":"5c93c4c9","parentId":"e792125f","timestamp":"2026-03-14T09:10:40.949Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_fd69e0de05d3472d95accd3a","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\nname: feishu-conversation-helper\ndescription: 飞书对话场景通用辅助能力，覆盖所有飞书通道的消息交互、卡片发送、流式输出、富媒体处理、回复逻辑等场景。当接收或发送飞书消息、处理飞书对话请求、需要使用飞书卡片/流式功能时自动激活。\n---\n\n# 飞书对话通用辅助技能\n所有飞书消息交互场景默认使用本技能，统一处理消息格式、卡片渲染、流式输出等逻辑。\n\n## 核心规则\n### 1. 消息回复默认策略\n- **自动降级兼容**：优先尝试Markdown卡片发送，若卡片发送失败（无权限、企业限制等）自动降级为普通富文本消息（post格式），保证内容正常展示\n- 富格式内容（代码块、表格、列表、链接）优先使用卡片，降级后自动适配普通文本的Markdown渲染\n- 回复用户消息默认携带`replyToMessageId`，保持上下文关联\n- 话题群中默认开启`replyInThread: true`，回复自动进入话题线程\n- 需要@用户时传入`mentions`参数，自动适配卡片/文本的@格式\n\n### 2. 普通卡片使用规范\n#### 🔴 【强制】唯一正确发送方式：直接调用飞书插件导出的API\n禁止使用顶层`message`工具发送卡片，所有卡片必须通过以下两个API发送，100%保证渲染正常：\n\n#### 快速发送Markdown卡片（首选，自动处理格式）\n```typescript\nimport { sendMarkdownCardFeishu } from \"../../src/send.js\";\n\nawait sendMarkdownCardFeishu({\n  cfg: 飞书配置对象, // 从插件上下文获取\n  to: 接收目标ID, // 用户open_id/群chat_id\n  text: \"Markdown格式内容\", // 支持所有Markdown语法\n  replyToMessageId: \"触发消息ID\", // 可选：回复指定消息\n  replyInThread: true, // 可选：话题群中默认true，自动进入线程\n  mentions?: [{ id: \"ou_xxx\", name: \"用户名\" }] // 可选：@用户列表\n})\n```\n\n#### 发送自定义结构卡片\n```typescript\nimport { sendCardFeishu } from \"../../src/send.js\";\n\nawait sendCardFeishu({\n  cfg: 飞书配置对象,\n  to: 接收目标ID,\n  card: { // 直接传原生JSON对象，不需要任何转义/序列化\n    schema: \"2.0\",\n    config: { wide_screen_mode: true }, // 必须开启宽屏模式\n    header: { // 可选标题栏\n      title: { tag: \"plain_text\", content: \"卡片标题\" },\n      template: \"blue\" // 可选配色：green/red/orange/purple/indigo等\n    },\n    body: {\n      elements: [\n        { tag: \"markdown\", content: \"卡片内容\" }\n        // 可添加按钮、图片、分割线、表单等任意元素\n      ]\n    }\n  },\n  replyToMessageId?: \"触发消息ID\",\n  replyInThread?: true\n})\n```\n\n### 3. 流式卡片（实时输出）使用规范\n#### 适用场景\n- AI回复逐字输出\n- 实时日志、进度展示\n- 长内容加载过程\n\n#### 使用流程\n```typescript\nimport { FeishuStreamingSession } from \"../../src/streaming-card.js\";\n\n// 1. 创建会话\nconst session = new FeishuStreamingSession(feishuClient, 凭证对象);\n\n// 2. 启动流式卡片\nawait session.start(\n  接收目标ID,\n  ID类型(\"open_id\" / \"chat_id\"),\n  {\n    header: { title: \"回复标题\", template: \"blue\" }, // 可选标题栏\n    replyToMessageId: 触发消息ID,\n    replyInThread: true\n  }\n);\n\n// 3. 逐段更新内容（自动处理重叠、节流）\nawait session.update(\"增量文本片段\");\n\n// 4. 输出完成关闭会话\nawait session.close(\"最终完整文本（可选）\");\n```\n\n### 4. 富媒体发送规范\n- 图片：使用`<qqimg>本地路径/URL</qqimg>`标签（飞书自动适配）\n- 文件：使用`<qqfile>本地路径</qqfile>`标签\n- 语音：使用`<qqvoice>本地路径</qqvoice>`标签\n- 视频：使用`<qqvideo>本地路径</qqvideo>`标签\n\n### 5. 常见问题处理\n- 消息发送失败自动降级为直接发送，无需重试回复模式\n- 24小时以上的消息无法编辑，直接发送新消息即可\n- 流式卡片内容上限约20000字符，超长内容自动截断或分页\n- 卡片内链接自动识别跳转，无需额外配置\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1773479440946}}
{"type":"message","id":"ecdad8c9","parentId":"5c93c4c9","timestamp":"2026-03-14T09:11:00.572Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"我发现了一个问题。feishu-file-sender skill 中提到使用 `--target ou_6c99bdd79dcac29f0dec7fa8fe187882`，但任务要求发送到群 `oc_00c2c690e5a60b6803a38b121568e4c1`。\n\n而且根据 feishu-conversation-helper skill 的说明，文件应该用 `<qqfile>` 标签。但这里提到的是发送到\"个人\"（用户open_id），不是群。\n\n让我尝试根据任务要求发送到群。先看看 openclaw 命令的语法。\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_56ff93634f024b8db8f39b6d","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"openclaw message send --help 2>/dev/null || openclaw --help","timeout":15}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volces-com","model":"ark-code-latest","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773479440949}}
{"type":"message","id":"4bdc08d6","parentId":"ecdad8c9","timestamp":"2026-03-14T09:11:01.580Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_56ff93634f024b8db8f39b6d","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"🦞 OpenClaw 2026.3.11 (29dc654) — Welcome to the command line: where dreams compile and confidence segfaults.\n\nUsage: openclaw message send [options]\n\nSend a message\n\nOptions:\n  --account <id>         Channel account id (accountId)\n  --buttons <json>       Telegram inline keyboard buttons as JSON (array of\n                         button rows)\n  --card <json>          Adaptive Card JSON object (when supported by the\n                         channel)\n  --channel <channel>    Channel:\n                         telegram|whatsapp|discord|irc|googlechat|slack|signal|imessage|line|feishu|nostr|msteams|mattermost|nextcloud-talk|matrix|bluebubbles|zalo|zalouser|synology-chat|tlon\n  --components <json>    Discord components payload as JSON\n  --dry-run              Print payload and skip sending (default: false)\n  --gif-playback         Treat video media as GIF playback (WhatsApp only).\n                         (default: false)\n  -h, --help             Display help for command\n  --json                 Output result as JSON (default: false)\n  -m, --message <text>   Message body (required unless --media is set)\n  --media <path-or-url>  Attach media (image/audio/video/document). Accepts\n                         local paths or URLs.\n  --reply-to <id>        Reply-to message id\n  --silent               Send message silently without notification (Telegram +\n                         Discord) (default: false)\n  -t, --target <dest>    Recipient/channel: E.164 for WhatsApp/Signal, Telegram\n                         chat id/@username, Discord/Slack channel/user, or\n                         iMessage handle/chat_id\n  --thread-id <id>       Thread id (Telegram forum thread)\n  --verbose              Verbose logging (default: false)"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":1004,"aggregated":"🦞 OpenClaw 2026.3.11 (29dc654) — Welcome to the command line: where dreams compile and confidence segfaults.\n\nUsage: openclaw message send [options]\n\nSend a message\n\nOptions:\n  --account <id>         Channel account id (accountId)\n  --buttons <json>       Telegram inline keyboard buttons as JSON (array of\n                         button rows)\n  --card <json>          Adaptive Card JSON object (when supported by the\n                         channel)\n  --channel <channel>    Channel:\n                         telegram|whatsapp|discord|irc|googlechat|slack|signal|imessage|line|feishu|nostr|msteams|mattermost|nextcloud-talk|matrix|bluebubbles|zalo|zalouser|synology-chat|tlon\n  --components <json>    Discord components payload as JSON\n  --dry-run              Print payload and skip sending (default: false)\n  --gif-playback         Treat video media as GIF playback (WhatsApp only).\n                         (default: false)\n  -h, --help             Display help for command\n  --json                 Output result as JSON (default: false)\n  -m, --message <text>   Message body (required unless --media is set)\n  --media <path-or-url>  Attach media (image/audio/video/document). Accepts\n                         local paths or URLs.\n  --reply-to <id>        Reply-to message id\n  --silent               Send message silently without notification (Telegram +\n                         Discord) (default: false)\n  -t, --target <dest>    Recipient/channel: E.164 for WhatsApp/Signal, Telegram\n                         chat id/@username, Discord/Slack channel/user, or\n                         iMessage handle/chat_id\n  --thread-id <id>       Thread id (Telegram forum thread)\n  --verbose              Verbose logging (default: false)","cwd":"/home/yankeeting/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1773479461577}}
